      "writtenOn": "2020-02-12T19:26:09Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Actually, this patch places \"packet mode checking\" almost in the end to override the rest of the setting. However, it should not override the settings by these conditions:\n- EC is off: If EC is off, then of course EC-CR50 communication cannot be happening, but we\u0027ve decided to make sure that EC UART won\u0027t be enabled if EC is off.\n- Bitbang is enabled: If EC is being programmed, then of course EC-CR50 communication is not going to be happening, but I wanted to make sure that any noise from DIOB3 (packet mode trigger) won\u0027t break bitbang mode.",
      "parentUuid": "05708e6b_e2404557",
